OL,3,GNEWSALibrary self-service saves
OL,4,A#300,000 in staff costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FLibraries in Worcestershire have saved
OL,7,Fmore than #300,000 in staff costs
OL,8,Fthrough a new opening-hours scheme.
OL,10,FLibraries Unlocked extends opening
OL,11,Fhours using self-service technology,
OL,12,Fallowing members to access libraries
OL,13,Fwhen staff are not present.
OL,15,FThe scheme is now operating at 11 of
OL,16,Fthe county's 23 libraries, according to
OL,17,Fpapers considered by a council panel.
OL,19,FHead of library services Carol Brown
OL,20,Fsaid some customers still preferred
OL,21,Fmore staffed opening hours, adding: "We
OL,22,Fknow it's not everyone."
